      "Language": "ukr",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The interventions efficacy, conducted on a nervous structures in 198 patients for occlusive diseases of the lower extremities arteries, in 68 of whom a femoral and sciatic nerves blockade were performed together with epidural anesthesia and open alcoholizing of sciatic nerve, was estimated. Efficacy of partial denervation in complex treatment of patients, suffering chronic ischemia of the lower extremities stages II - IlIA, was established, when performance of a direct revascularization is impossible because of a secured functional reserve present."},
